  "description": "Bounded simulator subset of the official AWS IoT FleetWise API (2021-06-17). Every other official operation returns HTTP 501 UnknownOperationException. Signal catalogs and fleets are configuration metadata: no vehicle, decoder manifest, model manifest, state template or campaign exists, so fleets hold no vehicles and no vehicle data is collected. CreateVehicle, CreateCampaign, RegisterAccount and the other vehicle and data-collection APIs return UnknownOperationException with HTTP 501. Signal catalogs hold no nodes: nodes, nodesToAdd, nodesToUpdate and nodesToRemove are refused, node counts stay 0, and ImportSignalCatalog and ListSignalCatalogNodes return HTTP 501. One signal catalog exists per Region. Fleets must reference a live signal catalog, but deleting a signal catalog does not check the fleets that reference it. Deleting a missing signal catalog or fleet succeeds, as the official operations model no not-found error; ListFleets listResponseScope is refused.",
  "title": "AWS IoT FleetWise (simulator catalog)",
  "version": "2021-06-17"
 },
